---
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";
import AboutImage from "../../public/20945597.jpg";
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="EGT Blogs"
  description="Welcome to the tech world of Egyanam"
  pubDate={new Date("February 14 2025")}
  heroImage="/EGT.svg"
>
  <p>
    Welcome to EGT Blogs, your go-to source for the latest in tech innovations,
    insights, and industry trends. At Egyanam Tech, we bring you up-to-date
    content that dives deep into the world of technology, helping you stay
    informed and ahead of the curve. Whether it's emerging trends, new software,
    or the future of tech, we've got it covered.
  </p>
  <Image
    src={AboutImage}
    alt={"sfsdf"}
    width={680}
    height={440}
    decoding="async"
    class="w-full max-w-[680px] h-auto rounded-lg mb-8"
  />
  <p>
    Our team of experts works tirelessly to bring you high-quality content,
    focusing on what matters most in the ever-evolving tech landscape. From
    software development to cutting-edge research, we strive to provide our
    readers with valuable information they can apply in real-world scenarios.
  </p>

  <p>
    Stay tuned as we explore topics ranging from React.js, cloud computing,
    software engineering, and more. We’re here to fuel your passion for
    technology and help you make better decisions in your professional and
    personal projects. Join us in this exciting journey as we continue to
    explore the limitless possibilities of the tech world.
  </p>

  <p>
    Our mission at Egyanam Tech is simple: to foster a community of like-minded
    individuals who are eager to learn, share, and grow in the field of
    technology. So whether you're just starting your career or you're a seasoned
    professional, there's always something new to discover on our blog.
  </p>

  <p>
    Thank you for being part of our journey. We hope you enjoy reading and stay
    engaged with our posts. Together, we can explore the amazing world of tech.
  </p>
</Layout>
